sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Person as a person or a script
    participant Program as Program<br/>src/App/App.Host/Program.cs
    participant Cli as Cli<br/>src/App/App.Host/Api/Cli/Pipeline/Cli.cs
    participant Action as CliCommand<br/>src/App/App.Host/Api/Cli/Pipeline/CliCommand.cs
    participant Sender as ISender (MediatR)
    participant Handler as PlanItemsHandler<br/>src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Commands/PlanItemsHandler.cs

    Person->>+Program: todo items plan --title "buy milk"
    Program->>+Cli: RunAsync(logger, "todo", version, args, resources, stdout, stderr)
    Note over Cli: parse: resource items, action plan, flag --title<br/>log "cli call received" with the flags
    Cli->>+Action: RunAsync(flags, "json", stdout)
    Action->>Action: read: PlanItemsCommand(["buy milk"])
    Action->>+Sender: Send(command)
    Sender->>+Handler: Handle(command)
    Handler-->>-Sender: PlanItemsResult
    Sender-->>-Action: PlanItemsResult
    Action->>Action: encode → {"items":[{"title":"buy milk","done":false}]}
    Action-->>-Cli: printed, no error
    Note over Cli: log "cli call answered" with the output, failed false
    Cli-->>-Program: null
    Program-->>-Person: the JSON line on stdout, exit 0
